It's like that famous horror film...
I shouldn't say the title.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.070
It's from the "ShXXXng."

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.360
It's a parody of that movie.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:50.040
There, you see?
I saw that photo.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:54.870
I didn't let on I knew because
I didn't want to scare you all.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:59.650
There, see... the dying message.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.240
"The End."

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.120
Bob Team Epic

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.230
Mayor, I've come up with an idea
for new playground equipment!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.350
Well done!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.690
How about a jetpack swing?

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:15.290
Jetpack Swing

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:18.580
No, that won't do.
It's too dangerous—

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.210
You'll still pay me for all my work!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.880
With your life!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.210
Live long.

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:44.730
Pop Team Epic Stories of Old

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:49.370
Would you like to know
what I'm reading?

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:50.800
I would.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.540
She turned into a tree!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:58.160
Pipimi...!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.620
If you go, I'll join you!

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:07.590
I would, too.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:10.810
And that's the way the story goes.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.700
Pipimi!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:22.820
How'd you get so big?

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.110
Science.

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:37.290
Oh, science.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.920
Oh, sigh...

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:48.490
Pop Team Cooking

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:52.690
Pop Team Epic Cooking.

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:53.600
Pop Team Cooking

00:19:53.600 --> 00:20:16.450
Pop Team Cooking

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:56.360
- Pop Team Epic...
- Cooking!

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.620
We're making rice omelet today!

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.970
I'll draw a heart with ketchup.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.870
Oh, this is so embarrassing!

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:12.990
You saw us.

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:16.290
Noooo!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.450
End

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:22.330
Bob Epic Team

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.990
Bob Epic Team

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.960
Correspondence Corner

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.880
We have a letter today.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:29.430
Bob Epic Team is lame and doesn't have
enough keyframes. Take note of other anime.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.240
That really hits hard.

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:34.390
Gotcha!

00:20:34.570 --> 00:20:37.600
I'll draw tons of keyframes
and make 'em move!

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:40.640
Eisaiharamasukoi!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:44.010
Eisaiharamasukoi!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:46.720
Eisaiharamasukoi!

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.410
Eisaiharamasukoi dance,
the real McCoy!

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:52.030
Explosion, Implosion, Beware.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:02.160
Something that happens a lot in france

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.630
is that people tend to be
pretentious about wine,

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:07.910
even though they don't know
what they're talking about.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:11.160
Here, Popuko is talking about her drink.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.070
Oh, Paris!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:23.600
The perfect day to enjoy a glass.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:29.230
Look! Texture as smooth as silk.

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:33.970
Color so clear, light shines through it.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.600
I'm tipsy from its fragrance!

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.630
Just finish that grape juice!

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.540
End

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:58.880
See you!

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:03.370
This must be heaven.

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:05.250
Preview of Final Episode

00:23:05.840 --> 00:23:08.390
As I searched to find myself
I remembered...

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:13.090
Five years ago, Sosogu died in my place
and became a star.

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:18.550
But thanks to Gaia's power, in exchange
for all my memories of Sosogu,

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:20.630
she brought her back to life.

00:23:21.110 --> 00:23:24.920
Now, she's about to lose her life
for me again.

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:29.890
This time, I want to keep
the promise I made with you.

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:39.860
Hoshiiro Girl Drop   Final Episode
"Sosogu and Daichi: A Precious Promise"

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:33.200
Hoshiiro Girl Drop, Final Episode:

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:36.010
Sosogu and Daichi: A Precious Promise

00:23:36.670 --> 00:23:39.350
We'll fall in love once again.
